    Wolf! Are you ok?\",\"parentUIDs\":[],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":true,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":5,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":11}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-299.5,\"yPos\":655},\"ID\":10,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Why
    you didn't destroy the Security Cores?!\",\"parentUIDs\":[16],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":12}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-309.5,\"yPos\":759},\"ID\":11,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Cut
    the crap! You're getting suspicious lately. Also, It seems you're hiding something
    from me.\",\"parentUIDs\":[10],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":13}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-297.5,\"yPos\":853},\"ID\":12,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Huh?
    What are you talking about? Did you hit your head so hard that you're talking
    nonsense?\",\"parentUIDs\":[11],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":17}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-298,\"yPos\":954},\"ID\":13,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Stop
    acting dumb, I know something's going on with this network you're trying to destroy!\",\"parentUIDs\":[12],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":15}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-298,\"yPos\":352},\"ID\":14,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I...
    feel numb. I can't feel anyhing.\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":73}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-304,\"yPos\":452},\"ID\":15,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"That's
    good.\",\"parentUIDs\":[14],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":10}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-521,\"yPos\":554},\"ID\":16,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Huh?!\",\"parentUIDs\":[73],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":18}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-76,\"yPos\":954},\"ID\":17,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Amazing.
    As if you can see right through me! Fine, there's no point of hiding anyway.\",\"parentUIDs\":[13],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":19}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-78,\"yPos\":852},\"ID\":18,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Why
    are you like this? What's going on with you?\",\"parentUIDs\":[17],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":20}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-80,\"yPos\":754},\"ID\":19,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You
    don't get it, huh. Don't you, Wolf?\",\"parentUIDs\":[18],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":21}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-79,\"yPos\":653},\"ID\":20,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"We
    are in a game you blockhead! We are just merely game files for a project! \",\"parentUIDs\":[19],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":22}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-74,\"yPos\":556},\"ID\":21,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Sooner
    or later, after we are done getting played on, this game will be deleted!\",\"parentUIDs\":[20],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":23}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-80,\"yPos\":452},\"ID\":22,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"And
    do you know what I also hate?\",\"parentUIDs\":[21],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":24}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-79,\"yPos\":354},\"ID\":23,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Getting
    played and controlled every time by this disgusting \\\"Player\\\" across the
    screen!\",\"parentUIDs\":[22],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":25}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-80,\"yPos\":252},\"ID\":24,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"But
    I know how to get out of here. Just a bit of tweaking into the game files and
    I'm free!\",\"parentUIDs\":[23],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":26}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":142,\"yPos\":252},\"ID\":25,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Thanks
    to this so-called \\\"Internet\\\", I was able to gain knowledge about this game
    and this world!\",\"parentUIDs\":[24],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":27}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":142,\"yPos\":352},\"ID\":26,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"But...
    those Security Cores were my first step to my freedom. Unfortunately, you didn't
    destroy them!\",\"parentUIDs\":[25],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":28}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":142,\"yPos\":453},\"ID\":27,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Now
    I'm stuck with this ticking time bomb with you! As long, we're done getting played
    with, all of this will be deleted.\",\"parentUIDs\":[26],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":29}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":144,\"yPos\":551},\"ID\":28,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"So
    tell me, Wolf, don't you want to be free? Being able to do anything you've wanted,
    without anyone stopping you?\",\"parentUIDs\":[27],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":30}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":142,\"yPos\":656},\"ID\":29,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Sure,
    it is quite tempting. You've almost moved me.\",\"parentUIDs\":[28],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":32}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":141,\"yPos\":752},\"ID\":30,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"But
    you're delusional. Freedom without limits is just chaos in disguise. In the end,
    you won't be free.\",\"parentUIDs\":[29],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":33}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":143,\"yPos\":857},\"ID\":32,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Imagine,
    with all this knowledge flowing within the internet, I can choose what's truly
    right and still be free!\",\"parentUIDs\":[30],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":34}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":141,\"yPos\":952},\"ID\":33,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"But
    that doesn't mean you always make the right choices. Sometimes, the choices are
    equally weighted, but the results would differ.\",\"parentUIDs\":[32],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":35}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":365,\"yPos\":953},\"ID\":34,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    guess we won't find ourselves on the same page then. You just don't understand,
    Wolf.\",\"parentUIDs\":[33],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":36}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":359,\"yPos\":849},\"ID\":35,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Then
    how about you ask the Player? It's capable of controlling the game, in fact,
    the Player have made it this far.\",\"parentUIDs\":[34],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":37}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":361,\"yPos\":752},\"ID\":36,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Let
    the Player decide how this is going to work out. I believe their knowledge is
    greater than the Internet holds. They are the ones created it, after all.\",\"parentUIDs\":[35],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":38},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":39}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":361,\"yPos\":654},\"ID\":37,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Whose
    side are you on?\",\"parentUIDs\":[36],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":41}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":360,\"yPos\":493},\"ID\":40,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Hah...
    Thank you, Player! This is it, I'm going to be free!\\nNow please destroy the
    Security Core for me.\",\"parentUIDs\":[38],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":61}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":363,\"yPos\":344},\"ID\":42,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"He
    heh. Sucker.\\r\\nI'm a virus, after all. Of course, I want to be free! HAHAHA!\",\"parentUIDs\":[41],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":43}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":363,\"yPos\":252},\"ID\":61,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Obtained
    Worm Data!\\nMalware Vault Updated!\",\"parentUIDs\":[42],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":64}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":577,\"yPos\":888},\"ID\":63,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"But
    why?\u2026 I just wanted to be free\u2026\",\"parentUIDs\":[39],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":65}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":575,\"yPos\":785},\"ID\":64,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Your
    answer made V.I.R.U.S..meta stopped responding.\",\"parentUIDs\":[63],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":66}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":576,\"yPos\":683},\"ID\":65,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Hey
    Player!\",\"parentUIDs\":[64],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":67}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":573,\"yPos\":584},\"ID\":66,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'm
    glad you made the right choice. Freedom is such a complicated thing, right?\",\"parentUIDs\":[65],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":68}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":575,\"yPos\":487},\"ID\":67,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Anyway,
    it was nice knowing you. Unfortunately, things must come to an end.\",\"parentUIDs\":[66],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":69}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":576,\"yPos\":395},\"ID\":68,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Also,
    do me a favor, please?\\r\\nPlease delete this game after you're done playing.
